      "start_line": 90,
      "text": "  rule scaleAcc(ACC:ValSeq, vCons(V:Val, REST:ValSeq),\n                LO:Float, HI:Float)\n    => scaleAcc(\n         valSeqConcat(\n           ACC,\n           vCons(\n             divF(\n               subF(projectFloatTotal(V), LO),\n               subF(HI, LO)),\n             .ValSeq)),\n         REST,\n         LO,\n         HI)\n    requires isFloat(V)"
